    },
    {
      "text": "Hello, you've reached VeloFit, my name is David. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768165495200000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, I need to start a return for an order.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 72498,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768165500333333
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. To get started, could I please have your order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768165503333333
    },
    {
      "text": "It's VF987654. I just need to send a helmet back. Is that going to be an issue?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 72498,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768165509266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for that. And just so I can properly document this for you, what specifically is the issue with the helmet? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768165514733332
    },
    {
      "text": "Preference. The color is not what I expected at all. The box is still unopened, it's brand new.",
